.	http://www.emsl.pnl.gov/ecce:annotation		ORCA, r2SCAN-3c, optimisation and frequencies of Na+(H2O)6, started from the xTB geometry of the step before. This calculation shows how the same arrangement (five waters in the first shell and one in the second) looks at the DFT level, so that its energy can be compared with the xTB energy and with the other arrangements.
